  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nBooks\nGifts\nOxfordshire and Buckinghamshire Light Infantry in WW1: 8th (Service) Battalion\n£3.50\n\nOxfordshire and Buckinghamshire Light Infantry in WW1: 8th (Service) Battalion quantity\nAdd to Cart\n\n \n\nOne of a a range of SOFO Museum's Battalion Booklets which each give an overview of the history of particular Oxford and Buckinghamshire LI battalions during the World Wars.\n\nResearched and written by James Pearson BA (Hons), previously an Archivist at the museum.\n\n15 pages.\n\n \n\nRelated products\nHistory of the 43rd and 52nd (Oxfordshire and Buckinghamshire) Light Infantry in the Great War 1914-1918 Volume II The 52nd Light Infantry in France and Belgium\n£30.00 Add to cart\nBugle & Sabre II\n£5.00 Add to cart\nBugle & Sabre VII\n£5.00 Add to cart\nBugle & Sabre I\n£5.00 Add to cart\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
